      "machineHash": "fb6dae6b38ef9be50f12f185fc0cd1249cb1542ce73a041cbbc84272905a7055",
      "machineText": "Wails v3引入了更灵活、更透明的构建系统，解决了上一版本的局限。在v2中，构建过程大多不透明且难以自定义，这可能会让希望更好地掌控项目构建过程的开发者感到困扰。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Wails v3 introduces a more flexible and transparent build system, addressing the\\ limitations of its…",
